    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the depths of the mountain, carve your own tunnels. Move at your own pace and listen to your instincts. Bring <strong>treasures</strong> to the surface and enhance your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain\u2019s belly is vast, dig wherever you please. If your intuition guides you well, you\u2019ll discover countless enigmatic <strong>chambers</strong>, <strong>corridors</strong>, and <strong>halls</strong> filled with riches. Once you\u2019ve gained enough experience and gold, you\u2019ll be able to purchase powerful tools. With these tools, you\u2019ll finally be able to solve the mountain\u2019s greatest secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now grab your <strong>pickaxe</strong> and head into the forgotten\u00a0<strong>CAVE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.poster.avif?t=1754581166\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.webm?t=1754581166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.mp4?t=1754581166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the depths of the mountain, carve your own tunnels. Move at your own pace and listen to your instincts. Bring <strong>treasures</strong> to the surface and enhance your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain\u2019s belly is vast, dig wherever you please. If your intuition guides you well, you\u2019ll discover countless enigmatic <strong>chambers</strong>, <strong>corridors</strong>, and <strong>halls</strong> filled with riches. Once you\u2019ve gained enough experience and gold, you\u2019ll be able to purchase powerful tools. With these tools, you\u2019ll finally be able to solve the mountain\u2019s greatest secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now grab your <strong>pickaxe</strong> and head into the forgotten\u00a0<strong>CAVE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.poster.avif?t=1754581166\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.webm?t=1754581166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.mp4?t=1754581166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
